WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.874
Mun na kongosogow be dɔnkili la sufɛ? O ye Songhai ka maana dɔ ye.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.778
Wagati tɛmɛninw na, kongosogow bɛɛ tun bɛ dɔnkirila tere fɛ; yiritu tun ye ɲanagbɛba le ye.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.378
A kumakan tun ka bon kosɔbɛ. Min yɛrɛ kɔrɔtanin lo, o ye a daa belebeleba ye.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.474
Ne ka fisa ni tɔw bɛɛ ye! Aw k'aw tulo malɔ ka ɲa.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.490
A tun b'a kan mina k'a fɔ ko: "Aw ye to ka dɔnkiri la. "

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:57.816
Hali ni mɔgɔ tɔw tun be ŋunuŋununa, a tun b'a kaan bɔ ka tɛmɛ fɔlɔ kan.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:12.488
Elefan, min tun ye kongosogow ka masacɛ ye, ale y'a latigɛ k'o yɔrɔ labɛn.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:17.202
Dɔnkilila ɲɔgɔndanba! Aw bɛɛ ka taga ɲɔgɔn fɛ!

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:23.714
U bɛɛ tun b'u yɛrɛ degi: waraw, wuluw ani hali kɔnɔw.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:36.716
O kɔ, u y'a fɔ a ye ko: "I ka kan k'i yɛrɛ degi. A tun lanin b'a la ko ale bena see sɔrɔ.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:47.560
Nka o bɛɛ n'a ta, a ka o kuma mɛn minkɛ dɔrɔn, o nana kɛ sababu ye k'a sɛgɛ.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:56.176
A jigira ka jigi a ta jese kan, k'a ta deregeba lalaga.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:14.832
O ɲɔgɔndan loon na, piyɔniye dɔ y'a daminɛ ka dɔnkili la.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:26.370
A kɛra i n'a fɔ a tun b'a fɛ cogo min na. A y'a fari funu, ka fara a kan.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:39.114
O kɔ, a yɛlɛnna k'a yɛrɛ don fanibugu kɔnɔ. O kɔ, a ka kɛ i n'a fɔ mɔgɔ dɔ ye.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:44.568
Mɔgɔw bɛɛ yɛlɛla.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:03:00.354
O ye maloya lo ye. O kɔ, tɔrisenjan jigira ka taga dogo ji kɔrɔ.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.384
U bɛɛ kɔsegira u ka soo wulafɛ.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:37.148
Su kora tuma min na, a yɛlɛla san fɛ dɔɔni dɔɔni. A ye filɛli kɛ a lamini na: mɔgɔ si ma sɔrɔ.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:51.140
O kɔ, a y'a daminɛ ka dɔnkili la. Ayiwa, karo gbarara ka na a lamɛn; lolow ka yeelen bɔ.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:57.952
Sanbɛrɛw tun b'a lamini.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:11.360
K'a ta o lon na ka taga a bla fɔ su fɛ, mɔgɔ si tɛ se k'a lɔgɔbɔ tuun.
